{% comment %}
  The guarantee line + optional info tooltip, shared across all variations.

  @param {block} block - the Subscription block (settings)
  @param {string} detail - '' | 'sub' | 'onetime'. Adds the V1 collapse hook
    (data-sub-detail / data-onetime-detail) so the line collapses with its box.

  The tooltip is a plain popover toggled by assets/buy-box.js (open/close, outside
  click, Esc). It sits absolutely above the row, spanning the buy-box column.
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign s = block.settings
  assign detail = detail | default: ''

  # The shared line ends "skip or cancel anytime", which is meaningless on a single
  # purchase: there is nothing to skip and nothing to cancel. The one-time tier gets its
  # own line, falling back to the shared one if the setting is emptied.
  assign line = s.guarantee_text
  if detail == 'onetime' and s.guarantee_text_one_time != blank
    assign line = s.guarantee_text_one_time
  endif
%}

{% if line != blank or s.guarantee_tooltip != blank %}
  <div
    class="buy-box__guarantee t-n1"
    {% if detail == 'sub' %}data-sub-detail{% elsif detail == 'onetime' %}data-onetime-detail hidden{% endif %}
  >
    <span class="buy-box__guarantee-text">{{ line }}
    {%- comment -%}
      No tooltip on the one-time line. Its content explains refill cadence, skipping,
      pausing and the subscription/Heist Society benefits, none of which apply to a
      single purchase, so on that box the info button opened an answer to a question
      the shopper had not asked.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% unless detail == 'onetime' %}
      {% render 'buy-box-tooltip', content: s.guarantee_tooltip, label: line %}
    {% endunless %}
    </span>
  </div>
{% endif %}
